---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Finicky Bee"
  description="Read the Finicky Bee Privacy Policy and learn how information is handled on the Finicky Bee website."
>
  <main>
    <Header />

    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Finicky Bee respects privacy and is committed to handling
          information responsibly and transparently.
        </p>
        <p class="updated">Effective September 22, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-content section">
      <div class="narrow">
        <h2>About This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how Finicky Bee ("Finicky Bee,"
          "we," "us," or "our") handles information in connection with
          the Finicky Bee website and its related public content.
        </p>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee is an independent collecting, research,
          documentation, storytelling, and resale business.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee website does not currently provide user accounts,
          direct checkout, or forms designed to collect personal information
          from visitors.
        </p>

        <p>
          Like most websites, basic technical information may be processed
          by the website's hosting or infrastructure providers when a visitor
          accesses the site. This may include information such as IP address,
          browser type, device information, requested pages, and access times.
          Such information is generally used for security, reliability,
          maintenance, and basic website operation.
        </p>

        <h2>Marketplace Transactions</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may offer collectibles for sale through third-party
          marketplaces, including eBay and Etsy.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you visit or purchase through a third-party marketplace,
          that marketplace's own privacy policy and terms apply to the
          information you provide there. Finicky Bee does not control the
          privacy practices of those third-party services.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee website is designed to provide public informational
          content and does not currently require visitors to create an account
          or provide personal information in order to browse the site.
        </p>

        <p>
          Third-party hosting, embedded services, or future website features
          may use cookies or similar technologies. If these technologies are
          introduced in a way that materially changes how personal information
          is collected or used, this Privacy Policy may be updated.
        </p>

        <h2>How Information Is Used</h2>

        <p>
          Information that may be available through normal website operation
          is used only as reasonably necessary to operate, secure, maintain,
          and improve the website and its public content.
        </p>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee does not use this website to build a buyer database,
          customer relationship management system, or personal profile
          database.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Websites</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee website may contain links to third-party websites,
          marketplaces, social platforms, or other external resources.
          Finicky Bee is not responsible for the privacy practices, security,
          content, or policies of those external services.
        </p>

        <p>
          Visitors should review the privacy policies and terms of any
          third-party service before providing personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee website is not designed to knowingly collect
          personal information from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may update this Privacy Policy when the website,
          business practices, or applicable requirements change. The updated
          version will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.
        </p>

        <h2>Questions</h2>

        <p>
          If you need to contact Finicky Bee regarding this Privacy Policy or
the handling of information described in this policy, please email
info@finickybee.com.

For orders or transactions made through a third-party marketplace,
please use the communication tools provided by the marketplace
associated with that order.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-note">
          This Privacy Policy is intended as general website information and
          should be reviewed and adapted for the specific legal and operational
          requirements of the business.
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="text-link">← Return to Finicky Bee</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">FINICKY BEE</p>
        <p>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
  <a href="/about">About</a>
  <a href="/finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
  <a href="/collection">Collection</a>
  <a href="/research">Research</a>
  <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
  <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
  <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
  <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
</div>

      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Finicky Bee. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f3ea;
    color: #30302c;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

   .text-link:hover {
    color: #2f4f3f;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    padding: 100px 28px 70px;
    background: #efe9dc;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #8b6b1f;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 52px 0 16px;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0;
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    padding: 80px 28px;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .legal-note {
    margin-top: 60px !important;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(47, 79, 63, 0.15);
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .site-footer {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 55px 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(47, 79, 63, 0.15);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 22px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #30302c;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .copyright {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 70px 22px 55px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      padding: 60px 22px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 45px 22px;
    }

    .copyright {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>